# PSR-6c4 — Harbor durable registration

## Intent

Close the seed-only register gap after PSR-6c3 durable list/detail:

1. Thin `createHarborRegistration` orchestrates published-tour gate + contact
   basics + email duplicate + `BookingPublicPort.createPendingBooking`.
2. Host gains `resolvePublicBookingPort` (same host adapter Denali uses — no
   Harbor Prisma).
3. HTTP: seed off + host configured → durable register under RLS write context;
   seed path unchanged for e2e.
4. `HARBOR_REGISTRATION_DUPLICATE` → 409 via generated http error map.
5. Tier stays `stub` (recert / proofs → later slice).

## Non-goals

- Denali nationalId/transport/profile persist clone
- Full Urban capacity/waitlist policy clone (Harbor uses booking capacity via
  `tourCapacityMax` in registrationIntake when known)
- Idempotency wrapper (deferred — email duplicate still fail-closed)
- CERT promote / `productionTier: certified`
- Full gates without YES

## Verify

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-6c4-harbor-durable-registration-smoke.mjs
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
pnpm --filter @app-tour/workspace-harbor run test
```

## Next

`PSR-6c5-harbor-durable-proofs-recert` — restart/idempotency/RLS evidence + CERT
rebind path (may pair with PSR-5i live YES).
